{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "koROBO",
    "steam_appid": 3119190,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119190/extras/5a298308aa0f350fb8403a48307d5d58.avif?t=1730274175\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere in the borough of Brocklyn, nestled within the urban jungle of New Yock City, Tom and his mother are celebrating his 10th birthday. When a wrapped present arrives, Tom rips through it, excited to see what\u2019s inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What he finds is...not, the coolest and latest in tiny household robo tech, but some knockoff model\u2014koROBO...? That\u2019s bogus!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But before long, koROBO is cleaning the home, helping Tom with his homework, and even playing games and reading comics with him like a brother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will koROBO\u2019s introduction have in store for Tom and his family?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TINY HERO, BIG ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119190/extras/ad1b480d436c450f0fc774efda8a44bf.poster.avif?t=1730274175\" width=616 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119190/extras/ad1b480d436c450f0fc774efda8a44bf.webm?t=1730274175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119190/extras/ad1b480d436c450f0fc774efda8a44bf.mp4?t=1730274175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse around the family home, clean up mess, and solve problems wherever you find them\u2014a big ask for such a tiny hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful, though! koROBO\u2019s battery is limited, and performing tasks will drain it even faster. koROBO needs to bathe in some rays in order to charge the solar battery strapped to his back. Keep an eye out for patches of sunlight to make sure you keep running at peak capacity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While exploring Tom\u2019s apartment building, you won\u2019t just be helping out him and his family\u2014there\u2019s a whole host of kooky denizens living out their lives that koROBO will encounter. Talk to these characters and solve their problems to unlock some of koROBO\u2019s most powerful upgrades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BETTER, FASTER, STRONGER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119190/extras/581521ecb1603550e0fcc1763f01dc2a.poster.avif?t=1730274175\" width=680 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119190/extras/581521ecb1603550e0fcc1763f01dc2a.webm?t=1730274175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119190/extras/581521ecb1603550e0fcc1763f01dc2a.mp4?t=1730274175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items as you clean and explore to upgrade koROBO and what they can do. While he will start out being able to run, jump, and glide, in time he\u2019ll also be able to fly, swim, and even travel through time?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait, but there\u2019s more! koROBO isn\u2019t the only toy in Tom\u2019s retinue. Discover new miniature friends and gain an assortment of attachments that\u2019ll allow him to adventure and sometimes even fight in new and exciting ways! The parts you\u2019ll need to find for your upgrades can be found all over the house. Collect as many as you can to upgrade Tiny Wonder!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOUSE OF FUTURE PAST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119190/extras/09c5035f107fdede008a9eabba850cb8.poster.avif?t=1730274175\" width=616 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119190/extras/09c5035f107fdede008a9eabba850cb8.webm?t=1730274175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119190/extras/09c5035f107fdede008a9eabba850cb8.mp4?t=1730274175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While koROBO has a whole apartment and family to clean and explore, you\u2019ll be doing much more than just traveling around the home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eventually, koROBO will obtain the radical ability to travel through time. When will you go with time travel at your fingertips?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119190/extras/5a298308aa0f350fb8403a48307d5d58.avif?t=1730274175\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere in the borough of Brocklyn, nestled within the urban jungle of New Yock City, Tom and his mother are celebrating his 10th birthday. When a wrapped present arrives, Tom rips through it, excited to see what\u2019s inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What he finds is...not, the coolest and latest in tiny household robo tech, but some knockoff model\u2014koROBO...? That\u2019s bogus!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But before long, koROBO is cleaning the home, helping Tom with his homework, and even playing games and reading comics with him like a brother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will koROBO\u2019s introduction have in store for Tom and his family?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TINY HERO, BIG ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119190/extras/ad1b480d436c450f0fc774efda8a44bf.poster.avif?t=1730274175\" width=616 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119190/extras/ad1b480d436c450f0fc774efda8a44bf.webm?t=1730274175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119190/extras/ad1b480d436c450f0fc774efda8a44bf.mp4?t=1730274175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse around the family home, clean up mess, and solve problems wherever you find them\u2014a big ask for such a tiny hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful, though! koROBO\u2019s battery is limited, and performing tasks will drain it even faster. koROBO needs to bathe in some rays in order to charge the solar battery strapped to his back. Keep an eye out for patches of sunlight to make sure you keep running at peak capacity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While exploring Tom\u2019s apartment building, you won\u2019t just be helping out him and his family\u2014there\u2019s a whole host of kooky denizens living out their lives that koROBO will encounter. Talk to these characters and solve their problems to unlock some of koROBO\u2019s most powerful upgrades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BETTER, FASTER, STRONGER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119190/extras/581521ecb1603550e0fcc1763f01dc2a.poster.avif?t=1730274175\" width=680 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119190/extras/581521ecb1603550e0fcc1763f01dc2a.webm?t=1730274175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119190/extras/581521ecb1603550e0fcc1763f01dc2a.mp4?t=1730274175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items as you clean and explore to upgrade koROBO and what they can do. While he will start out being able to run, jump, and glide, in time he\u2019ll also be able to fly, swim, and even travel through time?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait, but there\u2019s more! koROBO isn\u2019t the only toy in Tom\u2019s retinue. Discover new miniature friends and gain an assortment of attachments that\u2019ll allow him to adventure and sometimes even fight in new and exciting ways! The parts you\u2019ll need to find for your upgrades can be found all over the house. Collect as many as you can to upgrade Tiny Wonder!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOUSE OF FUTURE PAST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119190/extras/09c5035f107fdede008a9eabba850cb8.poster.avif?t=1730274175\" width=616 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119190/extras/09c5035f107fdede008a9eabba850cb8.webm?t=1730274175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119190/extras/09c5035f107fdede008a9eabba850cb8.mp4?t=1730274175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While koROBO has a whole apartment and family to clean and explore, you\u2019ll be doing much more than just traveling around the home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eventually, koROBO will obtain the radical ability to travel through time. When will you go with time travel at your fingertips?</p>",
    "short_description": "koROBO is an action adventure game that follows the story of a pint-sized robot named \u201ckoROBO\u201d and his owner, Tom, a young boy who receives koROBO as a gift from his father on his 10th birthday. Players step into the tiny but mighty shoes of koROBO, embarking on a thrilling and heartfelt journey.",
